{"ticker":"V","updated":"2026-10-24T00:24:43Z","profile":{"longName":"Visa Inc.","shortName":"Visa Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.visa.com","fullTimeEmployees":34100,"marketCap":765810769920,"trailingPE":34.7166,"forwardPE":27.152346,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":17.213873,"pegRatio":1.88,"targetMeanPrice":425.38864,"targetHighPrice":480.0,"targetLowPrice":330.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.144,"earningsGrowth":0.102,"grossMargins":0.97725,"operatingMargins":0.66130996,"profitMargins":0.50782,"totalRevenue":44487999488,"beta":0.771,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":414.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":293.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.65},"summary":"Visa Inc. operates as a payment technology company in the United States and internationally. The company operates VisaNet, a transaction processing network that enables authorization, clearing, and settlement of payment transactions. It also offers credit, debit, and prepaid card products; tap to pay, tokenization, and click to pay services; Visa Direct, a platform which facilitates money movement, enabling clients to collect, hold, convert, and send funds across its network; and issuing solutions, such as airport lounge access, dining reservations, shopping experiences, event tickets, and seller offers. In addition, the company provides acceptance solutions, an omnichannel payment integration with e-commerce platforms; risk detection and prevention solutions; and advisory and other services comprising consulting practice, proprietary analytics models, data scientists and economists, marketing services, and managed services. It provides its services under the Visa, Visa Electron, V PAY, Interlink, and PLUS brands. The company serves consumers, sellers, financial institutions, and government entities. Visa Inc. was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Visa Inc. 是一家在美國和國際上營運的支付技術公司。該公司經營 VisaNet，這是一個交易處理網路，可實現支付交易的授權、清算和結算。它還提供信用卡、金融卡和預付卡產品；點擊支付、標記化和點擊支付服務； Visa Direct，一個促進資金流動的平台，使客戶能夠透過其網路收集、持有、轉換和發送資金；並發布解決方案，例如機場休息室使用權、餐飲預訂、購物體驗、活動門票和賣家優惠。此外，該公司還提供受理解決方案、與電子商務平台的全通路支付整合；風險檢測和預防解決方案；諮詢和其他服務，包括諮詢實踐、專有分析模型、資料科學家和經濟學家、行銷服務和託管服務。它以 Visa、Visa Electron、V PAY、Interlink 和 PLUS 品牌提供服務。該公司為消費者、賣家、金融機構和政府實體提供服務。 Visa Inc. 成立於 1958 年，總部位於加州舊金山。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"信用服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":349.61,"h":350.72,"l":347.5,"c":348.82,"v":8019800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":348.69,"h":353.4,"l":347.45,"c":351.18,"v":5876200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":350.71,"h":353.43,"l":349.84,"c":350.35,"v":5531100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":350.6,"h":351.04,"l":348.6,"c":349.86,"v":4987100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":350.46,"h":352.63,"l":349.0,"c":351.78,"v":3671900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":349.31,"h":350.17,"l":346.08,"c":350.07,"v":4940300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":349.34,"h":350.89,"l":347.26,"c":350.87,"v":4176400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":350.73,"h":352.63,"l":349.15,"c":350.99,"v":4324000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":351.38,"h":352.62,"l":340.2,"c":343.22,"v":5448300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":342.34,"h":344.38,"l":341.0,"c":342.3,"v":4711600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":341.69,"h":346.32,"l":341.29,"c":343.99,"v":4646200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":342.61,"h":342.61,"l":336.44,"c":338.12,"v":6557900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":338.73,"h":343.53,"l":337.87,"c":343.49,"v":5157600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":341.22,"h":343.19,"l":339.17,"c":339.43,"v":3518300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":340.61,"h":342.71,"l":338.39,"c":339.05,"v":4367500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":336.24,"h":340.54,"l":333.47,"c":340.03,"v":5527700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":339.94,"h":346.2,"l":339.52,"c":346.2,"v":5763500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":344.73,"h":345.27,"l":338.18,"c":338.18,"v":7526600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":340.45,"h":342.69,"l":338.25,"c":341.61,"v":13674300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":339.01,"h":344.86,"l":338.66,"c":344.36,"v":5621800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":344.59,"h":345.26,"